                <tr> 
                  <td height="35"> <div align="justify"> 
                      <ul>
                        <li><font size="2" face="Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif"><em><strong>Drivers:</strong></em> 
                          Input, edit, and query driver data, including driving 
                          records and Driver&#8217;s License expiry date.</font></li>
                      </ul>
                    </div></td>
                </tr>
                <tr> 
                  <td><div align="justify"> 
                      <ul>
                        <li><em><font size="2" face="Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif"><strong>Events:</strong> 
                          </font></em><font size="2" face="Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif">Input 
                          and query data on fines, accidents, and incidents and 
                          view fleet performance statistics. </font> </li>
                      </ul>
                    </div></td>
                </tr>
                <tr> 
                  <td height="35"> <div align="justify"> 
                      <ul>
                        <li> <font size="2" face="Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif"><strong><em>Fleets:</em></strong> 
                          Input and query fleet mileage data. The option Vehicles 
                          allows inputting, editing, and querying data on those 
                          vehicles that comprise the fleet. </font></li>
                      </ul>
                    </div></td>
                </tr>
                <tr> 
                  <td><div align="justify"> 
                      <ul>
                        <li><font size="2" face="Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif"><strong><em>Activities:</em></strong> 
                          Input, edit, and query data related to completed activities 
                          (training sessions, assessments, etc.). </font></li>
                      </ul>
                    </div></td>
                </tr>
